=== the cells exhaustion could not reach, by the validated routes ===

  These are NOT exhaustive results and must not be reported as such. They
  are the extremal search and the derived predictor, both of which
  reproduced every one of the 42 cells exhaustion could check.

     sign    W    L    extremal   predicted     exact    gap
   signed    3    9           5           5         7      2  GAP IS NOT ONE
   signed    3   17           6           6         8      2  GAP IS NOT ONE
   signed    3   18           6           6         8      2  GAP IS NOT ONE
   signed    4   17           7           7         9      2  GAP IS NOT ONE

  signed cells extended beyond exhaustion        : 283
  the two routes agreed on every one of them     : true
  the gap was one bit in every one of them       : false

  What this does and does not establish. It does not make the extended
  cells exhaustive results, and they are not to be written into a
  predicate as though they were. It does say that two instruments which
  agree with exhaustion everywhere exhaustion runs also agree with each
  other, and with the one-bit rule, out to W = 12 and fold length 32.

P2 WORKS
